FORGE.pub – Authors
===================

Heiko Schubert — author of FORGE and of the novel Der EXPLOIT.

Robert Winter — the name this project is published under. Robert Winter is a
character from Der EXPLOIT, in which FORGE (the trading engine this project is
derived from) is explained and plays a central role.

Version 1.0 was released on November 17, 2026, the day the novel was published.

Der EXPLOIT — https://uag.de/buch/der-exploit/

An optional premium service (server-side calculated statistics, metrics, etc.)
is operated by an independent external provider and is not provided by the
authors.
